---
description: Project context and guardrails
alwaysApply: true
---

- Stack is Next.js App Router with TypeScript in `apps/web`, deployed on Vercel. Foundry and Solidity ^0.8.24 in `contracts/`.
- Product name only in `apps/web/brand.config.ts`.
- Never hardcode keys or addresses; read from env.
- Fans never put in money; do not add share or token sales for fans.
- Keep contracts small and add a Foundry test for every state change.
- Royalty ingestion is simulated in the demo and must be labeled that way in the UI.
- Do not add features outside `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` without asking.
- Crypto must be invisible in the UI: show dollars, never addresses or gas.
